# Docker
*.log
notes.md

# Code graph — rebuilt locally with `graphify . --code-only`; graph.json is ~28 MB
graphify-out/

# Machine-local agent tooling: third-party skill packs installed into this
# checkout. The repo ships exactly one skill of its own (checkmydata-mcp);
# everything else under .claude/skills/ is per-machine and must not become a
# second channel for packs that are installed globally.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/checkmydata-mcp/

# Supabase CLI link state (.temp carries the production project ref — an
# infrastructure identifier that has no business in a public repository).
supabase/
